2,"Boloki Language (BKT) – L1 & L2 Speakers, Status, Map ...",https://www.ethnologue.com/language/bkt/,Boloki is a stable indigenous language of the Democratic Republic of the Congo. It belongs to the Niger-Congo language family. The language is used as a first language by all in the ethnic community. It is not known to be taught in schools.,Boloki,Niger-Congo
